    "canonical_ref": "PL50.SA.3.s4",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Unde ct Apostolus : Obedire, inquit, præpositis vestris, et reliqua (Hebr. XIII, 17). Sed numquid is qui præcipit solus in laude est?",
    "chunk_index": 28,
    "context_before": null,
