  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/eucherius-lugdunensis/pl50_11_sa#PL50.SA.3.s5",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/eucherius-lugdunensis/pl50_11_sa",
    "canonical_ref": "PL50.SA.3.s5",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Nec ill qui obtemperat, dilectissimi, sine laudeerit? Ille me­ retur regendo gloriam, hie obsequendo.",
    "chunk_index": 29,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 434,
    "date_range": [
      420,
      449
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/eucherius-lugdunensis/pl50_11_sa#PL50.SA.3.s6",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/eucherius-lugdunensis/pl50_11_sa",
    "canonical_ref": "PL50.SA.3.s6",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Ad magnum ergo decus et mercedem ab unoque tenditur, dum alius bene consulit, et alius bene consultis obtem­ perat.",
    "chunk_index": 30,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 434,
    "date_range": [
      420,
      449
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/eucherius-lugdunensis/pl50_11_sa#PL50.SA.3.s7",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/eucherius-lugdunensis/pl50_11_sa",
    "canonical_ref": "PL50.SA.3.s7",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Hanc obedientiam maxime Salvator noster inculcavit nobis, qui non solum dum nos redemit, sed etlam dum obedientiam docet, salvare nos vo­ luit: aequalis enim Patri obedivit Patri.",
    "chunk_index": 31,
